| **Failing signals** | Pre-main link wall, crowded header nav, stacked chrome bands, homepage link-cluster / hero-control overflow |
| **Before example** | Failing handbook-style shell: `fs-primary-nav-global` + `landing-header` + `fs-sidebar` + `fs-cross-refs` before H1 + four hero `.btn` actions |
| **After example** | Passing `landing_page` shell: five curated `landing-nav-link` items, two hero buttons, `landing-hero-secondary-link` demotions, `landing-forge-visual` slot |
| **Evidence and remediation** | Metrics keys (`preMainFirstH1LinkCount`, etc.) + ordered fix steps |
| **Related rules** | 7 linked rules including `DET.BUTTON.GROUP.MAX` and `AI.CONTEXT.BURDEN_SUBJECTIVE` |

### Thresholds documented (from check implementation)

- Pre-main links before first in-main H1: **≤ 10**
- Outside-main header/nav links: **≤ 7**
- Nav chrome containers outside `main`: **≤ 4**
- First-viewport links (home only): **≤ 28**
- Hero-fold interactive controls (home only): **≤ 3**

### KS class verification

Before/after examples use real Kitchen Sink classes from `components/layouts.py`, `components/components.py`, and `css/forgesdlc-theme.css`: `landing-header`, `landing-nav`, `landing-nav-link`, `fs-primary-nav-global`, `fs-sidebar`, `fs-nav-tier-wrap`, `landing-hero-actions__buttons`, `btn-forge`, `btn-cyan-outline`, `landing-hero-secondary-link`, `landing-forge-visual`, `landing-forge-visual__img`, etc.

